    "text": "At an altitude <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></math> the acceleration due to gravity is<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">′</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>or</mi><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi>mg</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">′</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>mg</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>ie</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">w</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">′</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">w</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo